{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1413725-once-and-future-speculations","id":1413725,"title":"'Once and Future' Speculations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-15T01:02:45-07:00","id":1413725,"title":"'Once and Future' Speculations","content":"By today <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/demigod-semi-done-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Monady Meeting Notes</b></a>, there is new Scion 2E book in pipeline - enigmatic <b><i>Once and Future</i></b> <br /> <br /> Do you have any speculations what it will be about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T01:11:05-07:00","id":1413729,"title":"","content":"At a guess, the King Arthur/Welsh pantheon book. I hope that is true, as I've really been looking forward to it.<br /> <br /> (I'm hoping maybe it'll include something about the Anglo/Saxon/Jute mantles for the Aesir.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cu